  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/86f784f5-7087-4a18-8e47-45cb9f1d5a23.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 109px;\" />&nbsp;s reacted with reagents in List I to form products in List II</p><p>products in List II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"4\">List I (Reagent)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;List II (Product)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e9b7ca1e-a08c-463c-befd-bad3cae01260.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 108px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ab91210b-b62c-4fa2-8d6c-44f929671b1d.png\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 115px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HBF</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#916;</mi></mrow></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/52eff05c-a27b-44e0-ac32-0c0af363c271.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 102px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>Cu, HCl</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ebd6b0d7-3841-4ec9-a265-fb22ce59a5e8.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 69px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>CuCN/KCN</td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ff994660-4747-4109-9052-2ad0fdc4d27c.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 116px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:<p>&nbsp;</p>",
